review_*.md

# User MySQL schemas — NEVER commit. The whole tree is blocked at any
# depth; if we ever want to commit a *public sample* fixture (sakila etc.)
# we add an explicit `!path/to/fixture.sql` un-ignore for that file.
*.sql
*.sql.gz
schema.sql
**/schema/*.sql
